1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,865
A charity, a school or a club raises money by asking people to

2
00:00:04,865 --> 00:00:06,286
give what they can.

3
00:00:06,286 --> 00:00:10,777
This video shows how the Fundraising module runs a campaign on your site:

4
00:00:10,777 --> 00:00:14,926
donors choose their amount, the page shows how close you are to the

5
00:00:14,926 --> 00:00:18,280
goal, and every donor gets a receipt for their taxes.

6
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:25,406
A shop sells things at a fixed price.

7
00:00:25,406 --> 00:00:27,169
A donation is different:

8
00:00:27,169 --> 00:00:31,105
each donor decides how much to give, and many want to give in

9
00:00:31,105 --> 00:00:33,220
honor or in memory of someone.

10
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:38,155
Donors like to see that their gift matters, so a campaign needs a

11
00:00:38,155 --> 00:00:41,220
goal, and progress toward it, where they give.

12
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:45,898
And a donor who gives to a charity needs a receipt for their

13
00:00:45,898 --> 00:00:49,290
taxes, with the organization's name and tax number.

14
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:54,531
The Fundraising module covers all three, on top of the same cart and

15
00:00:54,531 --> 00:00:57,020
checkout as the rest of your store.

16
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:06,240
You set who donations go to, and what receipts say, once, under Settings.

17
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,890
A campaign is a product with the Fundraising campaign part:

18
00:01:10,890 --> 00:01:15,750
a goal, suggested amounts, a least donation, an end date, and whether gifts

19
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:17,190
get a tax receipt.

20
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:22,310
Donors give from the campaign's page, and check out like any order.

21
00:01:22,310 --> 00:01:26,560
Discounts and promotion codes never take anything off a donation.

22
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:32,520
Each donor is emailed a receipt, and finds it under Donations in their account.

23
00:01:36,708 --> 00:01:39,537
Open Settings, Commerce, Fundraising.

24
00:01:39,537 --> 00:01:43,944
Organization is who donations go to, as it reads on receipts.

25
00:01:43,944 --> 00:01:46,838
Leave it empty to use the site's name.

26
00:01:47,292 --> 00:01:52,812
Tax ID is your tax or charity registration number, printed on receipts.

27
00:01:53,264 --> 00:01:57,349
Receipt statement is what the receipt says about the gift, such as that

28
00:01:57,349 --> 00:01:59,524
nothing was given in return for it.

29
00:01:59,977 --> 00:02:02,971
Email donors their receipts is on by default.

30
00:02:02,971 --> 00:02:07,258
Untick it to have donors find their receipts in their account only.

31
00:02:07,258 --> 00:02:08,257
Click Save.

32
00:02:12,446 --> 00:02:17,817
A campaign is a product whose content type has the Fundraising campaign part.

33
00:02:17,817 --> 00:02:23,316
Open the list of campaigns under Content, Content Items, and edit the campaign.

34
00:02:23,767 --> 00:02:28,360
Goal is what the campaign raises toward, in the product's currency.

35
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:30,437
Leave it empty for no goal.

36
00:02:30,891 --> 00:02:38,285
Suggested amounts are offered as buttons, separated by commas, such as twenty five, fifty, one hundred.

37
00:02:38,285 --> 00:02:43,781
Donors can also enter their own, and Least donation sets the smallest gift.

38
00:02:44,232 --> 00:02:48,088
Ends says when the campaign stops taking donations.

39
00:02:48,088 --> 00:02:50,252
Leave it empty for no end.

40
00:02:50,704 --> 00:02:54,974
Tick Donations get a tax receipt when gifts are tax deductible.

41
00:02:54,974 --> 00:02:59,924
The product's price is hidden on the page, since donors choose the amount.

42
00:03:04,118 --> 00:03:08,295
On the campaign's page, the progress shows what has been raised toward the

43
00:03:08,295 --> 00:03:10,958
goal, how many have given, and the days left.

44
00:03:11,421 --> 00:03:15,171
Donors click a suggested amount, or enter their own.

45
00:03:15,171 --> 00:03:17,951
Amounts show in the donor's currency.

46
00:03:18,401 --> 00:03:22,154
They can name someone they are giving in honor or in memory of.

47
00:03:22,154 --> 00:03:25,581
That name is kept on the order, and shown on the receipt.

48
00:03:26,043 --> 00:03:30,547
They click Add to cart, and check out like any order, with whichever

49
00:03:30,547 --> 00:03:32,495
payment methods you offer.

50
00:03:32,495 --> 00:03:35,783
Once a campaign ends, it stops taking donations.

51
00:03:39,948 --> 00:03:42,101
Every donation is an order.

52
00:03:42,101 --> 00:03:45,688
Open Commerce, Orders to see them like any other.

53
00:03:46,144 --> 00:03:47,079
Open one.

54
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:51,503
The line says Donation with its amount, and In honor of shows the

55
00:03:51,503 --> 00:03:53,124
name the donor gave.

56
00:03:53,579 --> 00:03:57,171
Only paid donations count toward the campaign's progress.

57
00:03:57,171 --> 00:04:01,733
When you refund a donation's order, the refund comes off the progress, and

58
00:04:01,733 --> 00:04:03,729
shows on the donor's receipt.

59
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:11,802
A donor who is signed in finds Donations in their account:

60
00:04:11,802 --> 00:04:16,640
each gift with its date, who it honors, its amount and its receipt number.

61
00:04:17,094 --> 00:04:18,959
Click Receipt to open it.

62
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:24,554
It shows your organization, your tax ID and your statement, and the donor can print it.

63
00:04:25,010 --> 00:04:30,070
The same receipt is emailed to the donor when Email donors their receipts is on.

64
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:36,877
A library or a school fundraiser:

65
00:04:36,877 --> 00:04:40,220
one campaign with a goal and a closing date.

66
00:04:40,970 --> 00:04:43,692
A charity with a standing appeal:

67
00:04:43,692 --> 00:04:47,880
a campaign without a goal or an end date, always open.

68
00:04:48,630 --> 00:04:50,027
A memorial fund:

69
00:04:50,027 --> 00:04:54,920
donors give in memory of someone, and the name is kept on each receipt.

70
00:04:55,670 --> 00:04:57,136
Year-end giving:

71
00:04:57,136 --> 00:05:01,670
every donor gets a tax receipt, by email and in their account.

72
00:05:03,670 --> 00:05:08,620
With the Fundraising module, a campaign takes gifts of any size, shows its

73
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:11,591
progress, and gives every donor a receipt.

74
00:05:11,591 --> 00:05:13,200
Thanks for watching.

